## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema3_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,3,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema3_2 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,3,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,2)`
- `double bb_mid1 = iBands(NULL,PERIOD_M5,20,3,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- `double bb_mid2 = iBands(NULL,PERIOD_M5,20,3,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,2)`
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_M5,12,26,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- LONG: ema3_1 > bb_mid1 && ema3_2 <= bb_mid2 && macd > -pip_size (approaching zero from below)
- SL: 12 pips; TP: 12 pips
- P3 sweeps: BB deviation (2/3/4), MACD "approaching zero" threshold (0.5/1.0/2.0 pips), SL/TP (8/12/15)

